## Architecture

Five-layer Onion Architecture:

```
Presentation (WPF + MVVM)     — views, viewmodels, DI host entry point
Infrastructure                — EF Core SQLite, external adapters
Application                   — CQRS commands, queries, handlers (MediatR)
Domain                        — entities, aggregates, domain events (zero deps)
Common                        — primitives, contracts (zero deps)
```

Dependency direction: always inward. Domain depends on nothing external.

