## Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- .NET {{project.dotnet.dotnetVersion}} SDK
- Windows (WPF requires Windows)

### Build

```bash
dotnet build {{project.dotnet.namespace}}.sln
```

### Run

```bash
dotnet run --project src/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Presentation
```

### Test

```bash
dotnet test
```

